#. i18n: file ./firstrunwizard.ui line 38
#: rc.cpp:242
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<h1>Welcome!</h1>\n"
"<p>There are many media-players around these days, this is true. But what's "
"missing from most players is an interface that doesn't get in your way. How "
"many buttons do you have to press when simply adding media to the playlist? "
"amaroK tries to be a little different, providing a simple drag-and-drop "
"interface that makes playlist handling really easy.</p>\n"
"<p align=\"right\"><i>\"amaroK is seriously super!\"</i> - Uncle Rodney</p>\n"
"<h2>First-run Wizard</h2>\n"
"<p>This wizard will help you setup amaroK in three easy steps. Click <i>Next</i> "
"to begin, or if you do not like wizards, click <i>Skip</i>.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<h1>Moin-moin!</h1>\n"
"<p>Dat gifft dor een ganzen Barg an Media-Speelers vundag, dat is wohr. Avers "
"watt den meesten Afspeelers fehlt, dat is een Utsehn dat di nich in Weg steiht. "
"Woveel Knöpp mutt drückt warrn üm eenfach mal een Audiodatei to de Afspeellist "
"totofögen? amaroK probeert dat een beten anners to maken un kummt met een "
"Drag-un-drop-Interface dat dat Bedienen reell eenfach makt.</p>\n"
"<p align=\"right\"><i>\"amaroK is seriously super!\"</i> - Uncle Rodney"
"<br><i>\"amarok is ernsthaftig klaass!\"</i> - Unkel Rodney</p>\n"
"<h2>Inrichten-Dialog</h2>\n"
"<p>Disse Dialog wullt di hülpen amaroK in dree eenfach Stoop intorichten. Klick "
"<i>Wieder</i> üm em to starten. - Oder, wenn du keen Dialog gern harrst, denn "
"klick op <i>Övergahn</i>."
"<p>"

#. i18n: file ./firstrunwizard.ui line 84
#: rc.cpp:249
#, no-c-format
msgid "Interface (1 of 3)"
msgstr "Interface (1 vun 3)"

#. i18n: file ./firstrunwizard.ui line 132
#: rc.cpp:253
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Single window with player and playlist functionality\n"
"combined (like JuK)"
msgstr ""
"Aleen een Finster mit Afspeeler un Afspeellist\n"
"kombineert (as ok in JuK)"

#. i18n: file ./firstrunwizard.ui line 149
#: rc.cpp:257
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Separate player and playlist-windows\n"
"(like XMMS or Winamp)"
msgstr ""
"Twee Finster separat för de Afspeeler \n"
" un de Afspeellist\n"
"(as ok in XMMS oder Winamp)"

#. i18n: file ./firstrunwizard.ui line 182
#: rc.cpp:261
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<p>With amaroK you can use the window layout that you find most comfortable.</p>"
"\n"
"<p>You can change these settings at a later time using the configuration "
"dialog.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>Mit amaroK kannst du dat Utseehn wählen, wat di op't best passt.</p>\n"
"<p>Disse Instellen kunn ok to'n later Tied verännert warrn in de "
"Instellen-Dialog</p>"

#. i18n: file ./firstrunwizard.ui line 273
#: rc.cpp:266
#, no-c-format
msgid "Collection (2 of 3)"
msgstr "Sammlung (2 vun 3)"

#. i18n: file ./firstrunwizard.ui line 289
#: rc.cpp:269
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<p>Please select the folders on the right where your music files are stored.</p>"
"\n"
"<p>Doing so is highly recommended, and will enhance the features available to "
"you.</p>\n"
"<p>If you wish, amaroK is able to monitor these folders for new files and can "
"automatically add them to the collection.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>Wähl rechterhands de Orners ut wo dien Musikdateien steckt.</p>\n"
"<p>Dat nu to don is een echten Vordeel un warrt diene Mööglichkeiten mit amaroK "
"bannig vergröttern. </p>\n"
"Wenn du dat gern harrst, kunn amaroK dor jümmers nakieken un automaatsch diene "
"Audio-Dateien to dien Sammlung hentofögen.</p>"

#. i18n: file ./firstrunwizard.ui line 299
#: rc.cpp:274
#, no-c-format
msgid "Database (3 of 3)"
msgstr "Datenbank (3 vun 3)"

#. i18n: file ./firstrunwizard.ui line 349
#: rc.cpp:277
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"amaroK uses a database to store information about your music. If you are not "
"sure which to use, press Next.\n"
"<p><b>MySQL</b> or <b>Postgresql</b> are faster than <b>sqlite</b>"
", but require additional setup.</p>\n"
"<ul>\n"
"<li><a href=\"http://amarok.kde.org/amarokwiki/index.php/MySQL_HowTo\">"
"Instructions for configuring MySQL</a>.</li>\n"
"<li><a href=\"http://amarok.kde.org/amarokwiki/index.php/Postgresql_HowTo\">"
"Instructions for configuring Postgresql</a>.</li>\n"
"</ul>"
msgstr ""
"amaroK bruukt een Datenbank üm siene Informatschoon över Musik to sekern. Wenn "
"du nich weest wat to doon, denn klick man op <i>Wieder</i> un dat geiht al.\n"
"<p><b>MySQL</b> oder <b>Postgresql</b> sünd gauer as <b>sqlite</b>"
", avers se bruukt bruukt ok mehr Instellen.</p>\n"
"<ul>\n"
"<li><a href=\"http://amarok.kde.org/amarokwiki/index.php/MySQL_HowTo\">"
"Hülp üm MySQL intostellen</a>.</li>\n"
"<li><a href=\"http://amarok.kde.org/amarokwiki/index.php/Postgresql_HowTo\">"
"Hülp üm Postgresql intostellen</a>.</li>\n"
"</ul>"

#. i18n: file ./firstrunwizard.ui line 393
#: rc.cpp:286
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<h1>Congratulations!</h1>\n"
"<p>amaroK is ready for use! When you click finish amaroK will appear and begin "
"scanning the folders in your collection.</p>\n"
"<p>amaroK's playlist-window will show your <b>Collection</b> "
"on the left and the <b>Playlist</b> on the right. Drag and drop music from the "
"Collection to the Playlist and press <b>Play</b>.</p>\n"
"<p>If you want more help or a tutorial, please check out the <a "
"href=\"help:/amarok\">amaroK handbook</a>. We hope you enjoy using amaroK.</p>\n"
"<p align=\"right\">The amaroK developers</p>"
msgstr ""
"<h1>Glückwunsch!</h1>\n"
"<p>amaroK is nu al fardig! Wenn du nu <i>Fardig maken</i> "
"klickst, warrt amaroK starten un kiekt sich diene angeeven Orners an üm diene "
"Sammlung optoboen.</p>\n"
"<p>amaroKs Afspeellistfinster warrt diene <b>Sammlung</b> "
"linkerhand wiesen - un rechterhand de <b>Afspeellist</b>"
". Drag un drop Musik mit dien Muus vun de Sammlung to de Afspeellist un klick "
"<b>Afspeelen</b>.</p>\n"
"<p>Wenn Du mehr Hülp oder een Lektion hebben wullst, denn kiek ok mal in dat <a "
"href=\"help:/amarok\">amaroK Handbook</a>. Wi höpt dat du den Gebruk vun amaroK "
"geneten kunnst. </p>\n"
"<p align=\"right\">De amaroK-Makers</p>"

